WEBVTT

01:38.160 --> 01:41.070
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.100 --> 01:43.970
[Episode 19]

01:53.990 --> 01:54.720
Big Brother.

01:54.910 --> 01:55.920
Are you hurt?

01:57.009 --> 01:57.740
Big Brother?

01:59.090 --> 02:00.340
Here's some advice:

02:00.760 --> 02:02.200
when you speak to someone,

02:02.200 --> 02:03.350
think twice

02:03.590 --> 02:05.520
before acting like you're top dog.

02:06.040 --> 02:06.680
What are you waiting for?

02:06.680 --> 02:08.110
Help Big Brother up.

02:08.110 --> 02:09.169
Alright, alright.

02:17.680 --> 02:18.540
What happened?

02:19.430 --> 02:20.360
Why are you here?

02:21.030 --> 02:21.470
Hey.

02:22.000 --> 02:22.430
Big Brother.

02:22.430 --> 02:24.430
Are you a-alright?

02:24.750 --> 02:25.480
Big Brother.

02:25.870 --> 02:27.000
What's wrong with you?

02:27.000 --> 02:28.150
This is the home of the four of us brothers.

02:28.150 --> 02:28.750
Where else could we be

02:28.750 --> 02:29.630
if not here?

02:31.550 --> 02:32.550
Four brothers?

02:37.000 --> 02:38.060
What are you doing?

02:41.940 --> 02:42.800
Third Brother.

02:43.960 --> 02:45.120
Do you think Big Brother

02:45.120 --> 02:46.520
hit his head when he fell?

02:49.240 --> 02:50.640
Even if it is brain damage,

02:50.640 --> 02:53.640
it doesn't have much to do with the falling, actually.

02:53.910 --> 02:54.630
Naughty.

02:59.140 --> 02:59.680
Big Brother.

02:59.680 --> 03:00.960
We should get to work.

03:00.960 --> 03:02.710
It's almost time.

03:03.220 --> 03:04.950
We have a lot of work to do today.

03:05.190 --> 03:06.450
Let's go, Big Brother.

03:10.590 --> 03:11.980
Where a-are you going?

03:34.840 --> 03:35.680
Damao.

03:35.800 --> 03:38.400
Are you going to the street to buy steamed buns?

03:43.240 --> 03:44.590
Warm pancakes.

03:52.680 --> 03:53.720
Hoto noodles!

03:53.750 --> 03:55.079
Fresh Hoto noodles!

03:55.430 --> 03:57.310
One bowl is as filling as two!

04:00.680 --> 04:01.520
Guangping?

04:02.590 --> 04:03.190
Damao!

04:04.430 --> 04:05.030
Damao!

04:05.750 --> 04:06.360
Damao.

04:06.870 --> 04:08.330
You came at the right time.

04:08.430 --> 04:08.800
Look.

04:09.000 --> 04:10.530
Freshly steamed meat buns.

04:10.530 --> 04:11.430
I haven't even got a chance

04:11.430 --> 04:12.560
to take them out yet.

04:13.120 --> 04:13.560
Damao.

04:13.840 --> 04:15.060
20 buns as usual?

04:15.570 --> 04:16.130
Damao.

04:17.560 --> 04:18.510
Come here and have some pancakes.

04:18.510 --> 04:19.649
They have both vegetables and meat inside.

04:19.649 --> 04:20.360
Have some with a bowl of

04:20.360 --> 04:21.290
warm meat broth.

04:21.680 --> 04:22.340
I guarantee

04:22.480 --> 04:24.740
you won't have to eat another meal today.

04:32.810 --> 04:35.090
[A Spring Day in Guangping]

04:47.510 --> 04:48.440
I've had enough!

04:49.310 --> 04:49.720
Great!

04:50.000 --> 04:50.659
Throw them!

04:51.070 --> 04:52.400
This is Bu'er Bracelet.

04:53.630 --> 04:55.630
How did it become a physical object?

04:56.720 --> 04:57.480
Who cares?

04:58.750 --> 04:59.390
Look.

04:59.409 --> 05:00.680
They're fighting again.

05:00.680 --> 05:02.340
This couple fights every day.

05:02.830 --> 05:04.760
A man should marry a virtuous wife.

05:05.640 --> 05:06.430
If you don't want to be here, get lost!

05:06.430 --> 05:07.130
Fine!

05:11.640 --> 05:12.750
The destroyed objects

05:12.750 --> 05:14.280
have all become ink stains.

05:15.190 --> 05:17.920
Everything here is originated from ink.

05:19.000 --> 05:19.680
Could it be

05:20.600 --> 05:22.430
I'm in that demon's painting?

05:23.680 --> 05:25.450
Big Brother! Big Brother!

05:25.480 --> 05:26.210
Big Brother!

05:27.950 --> 05:28.680
Big Brother.

05:28.720 --> 05:29.430
It's almost time.

05:29.430 --> 05:30.430
It's time for us to go to the Huang Residence

05:30.430 --> 05:31.120
and carry the sedan chair.

05:31.120 --> 05:32.110
After getting this done,

05:32.110 --> 05:32.830
you'll have enough money saved

05:32.830 --> 05:33.950
to get married.

05:34.560 --> 05:36.220
Third Brother, you're right.

05:36.530 --> 05:37.780
After we help Big Brother get married

05:37.780 --> 05:39.050
with that money,

05:39.190 --> 05:40.430
I will be next.

05:40.430 --> 05:41.560
Then Third Brother.

05:42.360 --> 05:43.290
I'll be the last.

05:45.270 --> 05:45.870
Big Brother.

05:45.870 --> 05:47.480
You have to give me a hand.

05:47.510 --> 05:48.120
Don't bother me.

05:48.120 --> 05:48.560
Big Brother.

05:48.560 --> 05:49.800
Where are you going?

05:49.870 --> 05:50.600
Big Brother.

05:50.600 --> 05:51.920
You can't be like this.

05:52.170 --> 05:53.560
We've received the deposit.

05:53.560 --> 05:54.510
Where do you expect them to find people

05:54.510 --> 05:56.040
to replace us if we quit now?

05:56.430 --> 05:56.950
Besides,

05:56.950 --> 05:58.210
a wedding is a big deal.

05:58.409 --> 05:59.650
If we ruin it for them,

05:59.680 --> 06:01.070
they'll become our enemies.

06:01.070 --> 06:02.310
The four of us won't be able

06:02.310 --> 06:03.040
to make a living around here anymore.

06:03.040 --> 06:04.830
People will talk behind our backs in the future.

06:04.830 --> 06:05.870
Third... Third Brother

06:05.870 --> 06:07.390
is right.

06:08.560 --> 06:09.270
Let go.

06:09.560 --> 06:10.070
No.

06:11.720 --> 06:12.390
I won't.

06:15.560 --> 06:16.890
Why can't I apply force?

06:19.640 --> 06:20.190
Big Brother.

06:20.190 --> 06:21.390
Stop fooling around.

06:29.110 --> 06:30.190
Big Brother is too naughty.

06:30.190 --> 06:32.070
What should we do, Second Brother?

06:32.070 --> 06:32.560
Do it.

06:32.600 --> 06:33.130
Alright.

06:36.560 --> 06:37.720
Stop it, Big Brother.

06:37.720 --> 06:39.280
We should at least

06:39.310 --> 06:40.430
get today's work done.

06:40.430 --> 06:40.870
Right.

06:41.510 --> 06:42.170
Put me down!

06:48.390 --> 06:49.310
Big Brother.

06:49.950 --> 06:51.000
Lord Huang is the one

06:51.000 --> 06:52.750
who's getting married in a minute.

06:52.750 --> 06:54.800
He is the county commandant.

06:55.159 --> 06:56.159
If you run away now,

06:56.159 --> 06:57.360
we're all done for.

06:58.360 --> 06:59.090
Big Brother.

06:59.159 --> 07:00.630
Behave yourself.

07:00.670 --> 07:02.070
Don't act out of impulse.

07:02.430 --> 07:04.890
You can, but there's really no need for that.

07:09.800 --> 07:11.060
-Butler.
-Groomsman.

07:12.190 --> 07:12.750
Well,

07:12.950 --> 07:14.610
it's almost auspicious hour.

07:16.160 --> 07:17.360
Cheer up, everyone.

07:17.600 --> 07:18.480
His Lordship

07:18.510 --> 07:19.710
will be out in no time.

07:20.750 --> 07:21.880
Get the horse ready.

07:31.040 --> 07:32.040
Thank you, thank you.

07:32.040 --> 07:33.770
Wishing you happiness as well.

07:34.880 --> 07:35.560
Congratulations, My Lord.

07:35.560 --> 07:36.620
Congratulations.

07:37.920 --> 07:38.390
My Lord.

07:44.120 --> 07:45.190
It's okay.

07:45.390 --> 07:46.720
Today is my wedding day.

07:46.870 --> 07:47.830
I'm happy.

07:48.390 --> 07:49.000
Thank you.

07:49.270 --> 07:50.040
Youhuang...

07:50.600 --> 07:50.950
Big Brother.

07:50.950 --> 07:51.600
Why are you getting even more excited?

07:51.600 --> 07:52.530
Wait for me here!

07:52.750 --> 07:53.680
Wait for me here.

07:54.720 --> 07:56.600
We've prepared a banquet at our residence today.

07:56.600 --> 07:58.200
Make sure to come, everyone.

07:58.930 --> 07:59.840
Okay.

07:59.870 --> 08:00.470
Youhuang.

08:01.720 --> 08:02.780
Why are you in here?

08:03.600 --> 08:04.800
Have you seen Banxia?

08:06.310 --> 08:06.950
Banxia?

08:08.480 --> 08:10.040
How long have you been in here?

08:10.040 --> 08:11.300
Did you find anything?

08:12.190 --> 08:13.720
I don't know what you're talking about.

08:13.720 --> 08:15.120
I don't know you, either.

08:16.920 --> 08:18.040
You don't know me?

08:18.950 --> 08:19.750
How dare you!

08:21.390 --> 08:22.680
I know you now.

08:23.360 --> 08:24.420
You are the bearer.

08:24.430 --> 08:24.870
Go and

08:24.870 --> 08:26.630
carry the sedan chair properly for me right now.

08:26.630 --> 08:28.010
If you delay my wedding,

08:28.480 --> 08:29.510
see what happens.

08:31.480 --> 08:32.240
Sorry, Lord Huang.

08:32.240 --> 08:33.970
Congratulations, Lord Huang.

08:42.200 --> 08:42.870
Hurry up.

08:43.559 --> 08:45.290
Come on. Don't miss the time.

08:46.080 --> 08:46.840
Be careful.

09:01.010 --> 09:01.540
Let's go.

09:01.870 --> 09:02.730
To the bride's!

09:05.080 --> 09:06.200
Congratulations.

09:07.630 --> 09:08.790
Congratulations.

09:09.030 --> 09:10.090
Congratulations.

09:10.670 --> 09:11.390
Congratulations.

09:11.390 --> 09:12.450
Congratulations.

09:13.910 --> 09:14.970
Congratulations.

09:15.470 --> 09:17.540
[He's Martial Arts School]

09:21.480 --> 09:22.340
The bride

09:22.570 --> 09:23.770
is too shy to come out.

09:23.790 --> 09:24.360
Guys.

09:24.510 --> 09:25.370
Let's rush her!

09:25.870 --> 09:29.480
Bride! Bride!

09:29.960 --> 09:33.910
Bride! Bride!

09:35.890 --> 09:39.440
It's said that the bride is grounding the rouge under the candle.

09:39.440 --> 09:41.960
She's getting ready in front of the mirror.

09:42.390 --> 09:45.040
She doesn't have to put on the entire makeup.

09:45.480 --> 09:49.150
Keep her eyebrows undone for me to get them drawn.

09:49.180 --> 09:52.180
Bravo!

09:54.360 --> 09:56.880
Get on the sedan chair at the auspicious hour to celebrate your wedding.

09:56.880 --> 09:59.080
May the couple live happily ever after.

09:59.400 --> 10:02.000
The perfect marriage is a match made in heaven.

10:02.120 --> 10:04.850
The couple will live happily in harmony.

10:20.150 --> 10:20.750
Let go.

10:21.120 --> 10:21.720
Let go.

10:21.790 --> 10:22.860
Big Brother! Big Brother!

10:22.860 --> 10:23.990
How inappropriate!

10:26.530 --> 10:27.430
So out of line.

10:33.030 --> 10:34.270
My Lady, slowly.

10:34.480 --> 10:35.360
Be careful.

10:36.840 --> 10:37.680
Sit tight.

10:43.000 --> 10:44.790
Quelian is in good hands with me.

10:44.790 --> 10:45.990
Please rest assured.

10:46.080 --> 10:48.030
I'll take my leave.

10:48.870 --> 10:49.480
Dear son-in-law.

10:49.480 --> 10:50.250
Take care.

11:20.150 --> 11:21.910
So now, Youhuang, I,

11:22.200 --> 11:23.390
and those three brothers

11:23.390 --> 11:24.720
are all in the painting.

11:25.480 --> 11:26.360
Then

11:27.510 --> 11:29.080
Banxia should be here too.

11:30.670 --> 11:31.730
Congratulations.

11:32.150 --> 11:33.210
Congratulations.

11:33.670 --> 11:34.730
Congratulations.

11:36.270 --> 11:38.470
It's supposed to be a happy wedding day.

11:40.030 --> 11:41.120
How unlucky.

11:41.120 --> 11:41.670
Exactly.

11:43.360 --> 11:44.290
What's going on?

11:46.150 --> 11:46.790
My Lord.

11:47.040 --> 11:47.860
A few days ago,

11:47.880 --> 11:49.000
I heard that the Old Master of the Sun family

11:49.000 --> 11:49.600
was dying.

11:49.960 --> 11:50.600
Looks like

11:50.860 --> 11:51.990
we've run into them.

11:52.390 --> 11:53.630
What bad luck.

11:54.120 --> 11:55.510
Crossing paths with a funeral procession

11:55.510 --> 11:56.870
on his wedding day.

11:57.270 --> 11:58.870
It's quite a weird incident.

11:58.890 --> 12:00.000
Perhaps it can become something

12:00.000 --> 12:02.440
as famous as the Six Wonders of Guangping in the future.

12:02.440 --> 12:03.390
You went to Blind Liu for fortune-telling,

12:03.390 --> 12:04.720
and you got me this date?

12:05.130 --> 12:05.600
Well...

12:16.070 --> 12:16.840
Bride.

12:17.540 --> 12:19.400
We ran into a funeral procession.

12:19.450 --> 12:20.210
We won't be able to advance

12:20.210 --> 12:21.440
for the time being anyway.

12:21.440 --> 12:23.700
Do you want to come out for some fresh air?

12:24.010 --> 12:25.130
Are you insane?

12:25.830 --> 12:26.910
Which sedan bearers' place are you from?

12:26.910 --> 12:27.910
What’s your name?

12:30.320 --> 12:31.320
My name is Xuanye.

12:35.840 --> 12:36.920
Big Brother. Big Brother.

12:36.920 --> 12:38.380
Your name is Damao. Damao.

12:38.750 --> 12:39.390
You brat.

12:39.600 --> 12:40.660
I'll remember you.

12:40.670 --> 12:41.360
Don't even think about

12:41.360 --> 12:42.560
working in this business again.

12:42.560 --> 12:43.690
Please don't say that.

12:43.690 --> 12:44.380
Calm down.

12:44.480 --> 12:45.540
Calm down, please.

12:46.910 --> 12:47.840
Thank you.

12:49.600 --> 12:50.240
Congratulations.

12:50.240 --> 12:52.600
Please drink to your heart's content tonight.

12:52.600 --> 12:53.440
Sure.

12:54.790 --> 12:55.790
Congratulations.

12:55.790 --> 12:56.380
Congratulations, My Lord.

12:56.380 --> 12:58.020
Thank you.

12:59.390 --> 13:00.300
Stop the sedan!

13:01.200 --> 13:07.810
[Huang Residence]

13:01.700 --> 13:02.630
Lower the sedan!

13:04.190 --> 13:05.190
Look at the bride.

13:07.460 --> 13:08.970
Welcome the bride!

13:18.980 --> 13:21.040
What are you doing? Get out of the way.

13:23.050 --> 13:23.690
My Lady.

13:24.270 --> 13:25.930
It's time to get off the sedan.

13:27.440 --> 13:28.750
My Lady, please be careful.

13:28.750 --> 13:30.570
The bride crosses the saddle,

13:31.050 --> 13:33.450
and the household will be in peace forever.

13:34.120 --> 13:35.450
What happened just now?

13:36.200 --> 13:37.060
It was nothing.

13:37.600 --> 13:39.120
We ran into a scoundrel.

13:44.200 --> 13:44.930
Big Brother.

13:44.950 --> 13:46.290
We have to take the back door to get the reward money.

13:46.290 --> 13:47.670
The front door is not for us.

13:47.670 --> 13:48.510
Stop it.

13:49.750 --> 13:50.390
Everyone.

13:50.510 --> 13:52.850
Today is a day of great joy for the Huang Residence.

13:52.850 --> 13:54.670
Master said there will be rewards for everyone.

13:54.670 --> 13:56.510
Come with me to the backyard to collect the rewards

13:56.510 --> 13:57.790
and have some wedding candies.

13:57.790 --> 13:59.150
We are lucky to be here today.

13:59.150 --> 14:00.510
Not only can we get the rewards,

14:00.510 --> 14:02.750
but we can also join the wedding banquet.

14:02.750 --> 14:03.440
Let's go.

14:03.870 --> 14:05.800
Can you stop carrying me like this?

14:06.440 --> 14:07.300
Okay, Brother.

14:10.240 --> 14:11.640
What's the point of this?

14:11.910 --> 14:14.550
May you and your wife live happily ever after, My Lord.

14:14.550 --> 14:15.080
Good.

14:15.360 --> 14:16.020
Reward him.

14:16.390 --> 14:18.310
May you have a baby soon, My Lord.

14:18.600 --> 14:19.480
Not bad. Give him a reward too.

14:19.480 --> 14:20.480
Okay, thank you.

14:20.480 --> 14:21.150
Next.

14:22.870 --> 14:26.330
May you grow old together.

14:27.270 --> 14:28.030
Good. Bravo.

14:28.240 --> 14:29.200
Next.

14:30.840 --> 14:31.640
Eternal love.

14:32.360 --> 14:32.870
Reward.

14:33.000 --> 14:34.030
Get a wedding candy, too.

14:34.030 --> 14:34.600
Take it.

14:35.200 --> 14:35.790
Thank you.

14:35.790 --> 14:36.360
Next.

14:37.030 --> 14:39.750
Wish you and your wife...

14:40.610 --> 14:42.070
A happy birthday, My Lord!

14:42.320 --> 14:43.780
I'll let you off this time.

14:43.950 --> 14:44.580
Come on.

14:45.120 --> 14:45.870
Next.

14:48.030 --> 14:49.550
May you and your wife live happily ever after

14:49.550 --> 14:50.000
and have a baby soon, My Lord.

14:50.000 --> 14:50.510
Good.

14:50.910 --> 14:51.600
Well said.

14:52.840 --> 14:53.670
The bride is here.

14:53.670 --> 14:54.670
The bride is here.

14:54.840 --> 14:55.840
The bride is here.

15:02.240 --> 15:03.840
Look into the mirror and bow.

15:03.840 --> 15:05.170
The couple becomes one.

15:06.080 --> 15:08.410
Evil spirits shall be exorcised forever.

15:09.960 --> 15:11.000
The first kowtow is for

15:11.000 --> 15:12.270
growing old together,

15:12.670 --> 15:14.800
and living in harmony like lovebirds.

15:19.670 --> 15:21.000
The second kowtow is for

15:21.030 --> 15:22.720
expressing gratitude to your parents for raising you,

15:22.720 --> 15:24.380
and wishing them good health.

15:29.960 --> 15:31.030
The third kowtow is for

15:31.030 --> 15:32.490
a harmonious marital life

15:32.670 --> 15:34.080
and being united as one.

15:46.240 --> 15:46.840
Banxia.

15:47.360 --> 15:48.290
It's really you.

15:49.360 --> 15:50.390
It's you again!

15:53.530 --> 15:55.510
You're really out of your mind, you brat.

15:55.510 --> 15:57.370
How dare you harass Her Ladyship?

15:57.960 --> 15:59.150
You'll be in for it

15:59.390 --> 16:01.510
after His Lordship finishes his business today.

16:01.510 --> 16:01.960
Let's go.

16:01.960 --> 16:02.490
Let's go.

16:18.710 --> 16:20.120
This bearer is really bold.

16:20.120 --> 16:21.480
He even dared to harass Her Ladyship.

16:21.480 --> 16:22.030
Exactly.

16:22.150 --> 16:24.410
He deserves to be detained here for days.

16:25.200 --> 16:25.730
Brother.

16:26.030 --> 16:26.600
They were saying

16:26.600 --> 16:27.840
a bearer was arrested.

16:27.840 --> 16:29.000
A-Aren't we

16:29.000 --> 16:30.510
the b-bearers?

16:31.440 --> 16:32.200
Right.

16:33.510 --> 16:34.240
Third Brother.

16:34.240 --> 16:35.170
Fourth Brother.

16:35.440 --> 16:36.120
Second Brother.

16:36.120 --> 16:37.120
Where is Big Brother?

16:37.120 --> 16:37.600
Oh no.

16:37.600 --> 16:38.600
So Big Brother was arrested.

16:38.600 --> 16:39.000
Big...

16:39.150 --> 16:40.750
Something happened to Big Brother.

16:40.750 --> 16:41.910
Go look for him!

16:43.910 --> 16:44.960
Are you stupid?

17:11.480 --> 17:12.240
Second Brother.

17:12.240 --> 17:13.369
Big Brother is here.

17:13.960 --> 17:14.510
Damao!

17:15.480 --> 17:16.210
Big Brother!

17:17.510 --> 17:18.240
Big Brother!

17:18.310 --> 17:19.569
We're here to save you.

17:25.589 --> 17:27.000
Find a way to open the door.

17:27.000 --> 17:27.829
Okay.

17:34.400 --> 17:35.590
Why don't we kick it open with our feet, Second Brother?

17:35.590 --> 17:37.030
Big Brother! Stay clear.

17:40.590 --> 17:41.320
Big Brother.

17:41.830 --> 17:42.830
Did they hit you?

17:42.960 --> 17:44.060
Big Brother, does it hurt?

17:44.060 --> 17:44.680
Are you alright?

17:44.680 --> 17:45.590
I'm alright. I'm alright.

17:45.590 --> 17:45.920
Let's go!

17:45.920 --> 17:46.830
Let's go.

17:47.130 --> 17:47.480
But...

17:47.480 --> 17:48.440
Let's go.

17:49.350 --> 17:50.350
Brother.

17:51.540 --> 17:52.400
You guys go first.

17:52.400 --> 17:54.000
I still have something to do.

17:54.110 --> 17:55.240
Where are you going?

17:55.320 --> 17:57.050
This has nothing to do with you.

17:57.310 --> 17:58.200
Go home first.

17:58.920 --> 18:00.720
Big Brother is going to make a scene in the bridal chamber.

18:00.720 --> 18:01.850
Big Brother asked us

18:02.240 --> 18:03.350
to wait here

18:03.590 --> 18:04.200
or go home.

18:04.400 --> 18:04.750
But

18:04.750 --> 18:06.950
what if Big Brother gets arrested again

18:07.570 --> 18:08.160
later?

18:08.350 --> 18:09.610
What should we do then?

18:10.830 --> 18:11.690
We might as well

18:12.000 --> 18:13.030
save him again.

18:16.310 --> 18:17.030
My Lady.

18:17.260 --> 18:18.390
Don't overthink it.

18:18.500 --> 18:19.520
His Lordship has arrested

18:19.520 --> 18:20.250
that madman.

18:20.380 --> 18:21.910
He won't let him off easily.

18:48.920 --> 18:50.320
My Lady, have some water.

18:55.510 --> 18:56.840
Are you hungry, My Lady?

18:56.900 --> 18:58.500
Do you want something to eat?

18:59.030 --> 19:01.230
I haven't eaten all day. Of course I'm hungry.

19:01.230 --> 19:02.020
I'll go get some nuts

19:02.020 --> 19:02.980
for you, My Lady.

19:05.740 --> 19:06.870
Wait for a moment, My Lady.

19:06.870 --> 19:07.930
I'll be right back.

19:21.310 --> 19:22.350
You again?

19:23.730 --> 19:24.990
You don't remember me?

19:27.830 --> 19:28.350
Right.

19:28.960 --> 19:30.270
You must have forgotten too.

19:30.270 --> 19:31.040
Otherwise,

19:31.140 --> 19:33.200
you wouldn't have married Youhuang.

19:35.500 --> 19:36.160
I don't have the time

19:36.160 --> 19:37.240
to explain everything to you now.

19:37.240 --> 19:37.920
Come with me.

19:37.920 --> 19:39.180
Don't come any closer!

19:40.030 --> 19:41.030
Stay away from me.

19:43.870 --> 19:44.650
Are you leaving or not?

19:44.650 --> 19:45.240
If you don't leave now,

19:45.240 --> 19:46.510
this won't just be thrown on the ground, got it?

19:46.510 --> 19:47.610
Calm down.

19:47.760 --> 19:48.830
I have no ill intentions towards you.

19:48.830 --> 19:49.510
I won't hurt you.

19:49.510 --> 19:50.770
Are you leaving or not?

19:51.420 --> 19:52.750
I haven't finished yet.

19:52.960 --> 19:53.890
I'm not leaving.

19:57.120 --> 19:58.510
Let me explain.

19:58.680 --> 19:59.350
What you see

19:59.350 --> 20:00.070
with your eyes right now

20:00.070 --> 20:00.680
is all fake,

20:00.680 --> 20:01.790
except me.

20:02.070 --> 20:02.640
We are now

20:02.640 --> 20:03.880
trapped in a painting.

20:03.880 --> 20:05.810
I'm here to help you get out of here.

20:06.350 --> 20:06.880
You'd better think about

20:06.880 --> 20:08.310
how you can get out yourself first.

20:08.310 --> 20:08.970
Hey, you...

20:10.720 --> 20:11.580
It's you again.

20:13.280 --> 20:13.910
Youhuang.

20:14.160 --> 20:14.990
Listen to me.

20:16.230 --> 20:18.090
Don't be afraid, Honey. I'm here.

20:20.790 --> 20:22.070
How dare you.

20:22.880 --> 20:24.400
You failed to ruin my wedding,

20:24.400 --> 20:25.780
so you broke into my bridal chamber

20:25.780 --> 20:27.210
and even tried to molest my wife.

20:27.210 --> 20:28.880
I should have killed you just now!

20:28.880 --> 20:30.010
You misunderstood.

20:30.080 --> 20:31.240
The relationship between you two is not

20:31.240 --> 20:32.200
what you think it is.

20:32.200 --> 20:33.200
You're blinded.

20:33.350 --> 20:34.700
I misunderstood?

20:35.290 --> 20:37.520
Our relationship is not what it seems to be?

20:37.520 --> 20:38.070
What do you scoundrel

20:38.070 --> 20:38.920
intend to do!

20:39.400 --> 20:40.400
It's not like that.

20:40.400 --> 20:41.240
Wake up!

20:42.000 --> 20:43.110
I wake up?

20:44.400 --> 20:45.930
I'll help you wake up first!

20:58.200 --> 20:58.930
Big Brother.

20:59.070 --> 21:00.030
Are you hurt?

21:01.310 --> 21:01.830
What are you waiting for?

21:01.830 --> 21:03.550
Help Big Brother up.

21:10.080 --> 21:11.480
Why were you so careless?

21:16.640 --> 21:17.500
What happened?

21:18.830 --> 21:19.830
Why are you here?

21:20.700 --> 21:22.610
We... We were just talking about

21:22.640 --> 21:24.480
getting to work.

21:25.350 --> 21:26.080
Big Brother.

21:26.240 --> 21:27.360
What's wrong with you?

21:27.360 --> 21:28.720
This is the home of the four of us brothers.

21:28.720 --> 21:29.240
Where else could we be

21:29.240 --> 21:30.110
if not here?

21:31.310 --> 21:32.170
Four brothers?

21:39.880 --> 21:40.440
Sanmao.

21:40.880 --> 21:42.590
Do you think

21:42.640 --> 21:44.040
Big Brother hit his head?

21:44.720 --> 21:46.030
Even if it is brain damage,

21:46.030 --> 21:48.630
I don't think it has much to do with the falling.

21:49.440 --> 21:50.890
He's just naughty like that.

21:50.890 --> 21:52.650
Brother, we need to get to work.

21:52.680 --> 21:54.680
It's almost time.

21:56.240 --> 21:58.050
We still have a full day's work ahead of us.

21:58.050 --> 21:59.310
Let's go, Big Brother.

22:01.750 --> 22:03.750
W-Where are you going, Big Brother?

22:04.000 --> 22:05.130
Where are you going?

22:23.240 --> 22:24.000
Damao.

22:24.550 --> 22:27.150
Are you going to the street to buy steamed buns?

22:34.000 --> 22:34.930
Enjoy your meal.

22:35.270 --> 22:35.830
Damao!

22:36.960 --> 22:37.510
Damao!

22:37.750 --> 22:39.280
Freshly steamed meat buns.

22:39.400 --> 22:40.270
I haven't even got a chance

22:40.270 --> 22:41.400
to take them out yet.

22:41.590 --> 22:42.720
20 buns as usual...

22:43.070 --> 22:43.550
Damao.

22:44.000 --> 22:45.240
20 buns as usual?

22:46.070 --> 22:46.550
Damao.

22:46.830 --> 22:47.640
Come here and have some pancakes.

22:47.640 --> 22:48.720
Come here and have some pancakes.

22:48.720 --> 22:49.830
They have both vegetables and meat inside.

22:49.830 --> 22:50.480
Eat it with a bowl of

22:50.480 --> 22:51.410
warm meat broth.

22:51.440 --> 22:52.100
I guarantee

22:52.160 --> 22:54.420
you won't have to eat another meal today.

23:06.440 --> 23:07.410
Look up.

23:07.440 --> 23:08.410
Open your eyes.

23:08.510 --> 23:10.590
The Six Wonders of Guangping are magnificent.

23:10.590 --> 23:11.550
The grand mountains,

23:11.550 --> 23:12.510
the gorgeous blossoms.

23:12.510 --> 23:15.000
The century-old pride and grace peak at the present.

23:15.000 --> 23:15.840
Recite it again.

23:15.840 --> 23:16.690
Look up.

23:16.720 --> 23:17.680
Open your eyes.

23:17.880 --> 23:19.880
The Six Wonders of Guangping are magnificent.

23:19.880 --> 23:20.750
The grand mountains,

23:20.750 --> 23:21.810
the gorgeous blossoms.

23:21.810 --> 23:22.520
Big Brother!

23:22.520 --> 23:23.350
What's the urgent matter?

23:23.350 --> 23:24.670
Why did you run so fast?

23:25.010 --> 23:25.590
That's right.

23:25.590 --> 23:26.790
We have to finish this job

23:26.790 --> 23:27.960
no matter what the urgent matter is.

23:27.960 --> 23:28.750
After we get this work done,

23:28.750 --> 23:30.890
you'll have enough money to get married.

23:30.890 --> 23:32.760
Third Brother, you're right.

23:33.230 --> 23:34.440
After we have enough money saved

23:34.440 --> 23:35.660
and help Big Brother get married,

23:35.660 --> 23:37.340
I will be next.

23:37.480 --> 23:38.790
Then Third Brother.

23:38.790 --> 23:39.720
I'll be the last.

23:41.550 --> 23:42.720
I have something important to do.

23:42.720 --> 23:43.850
You guys get to work.

23:44.000 --> 23:44.660
I have to go.

23:45.310 --> 23:46.000
Big Brother.

23:46.000 --> 23:47.600
Let's finish our work first.

23:48.390 --> 23:49.070
When we come back,

23:49.070 --> 23:50.870
we'll help you with your matter.

23:50.960 --> 23:51.690
Big Brother.

23:52.000 --> 23:53.550
We've already taken the deposit for this job.

23:53.550 --> 23:54.330
Where do you expect them to find people to replace us

23:54.330 --> 23:55.770
if we quit now?

23:56.070 --> 23:56.960
It'll be a big deal

23:56.960 --> 23:57.780
if we delay their wedding.

23:57.780 --> 23:58.590
People will talk behind our backs

23:58.590 --> 23:59.520
in the future.

23:59.550 --> 24:02.090
Third... Third Brother is right.

24:02.510 --> 24:03.370
Third Brother.

24:04.920 --> 24:05.830
Wait! Wait!

24:05.920 --> 24:06.960
Hold on. Hold on.

24:09.330 --> 24:09.890
Look!

24:13.680 --> 24:14.500
What are we supposed to see?

24:14.500 --> 24:15.230
I don't know.

24:15.410 --> 24:16.140
I don't know.

24:17.510 --> 24:18.790
-Big Brother.
-Where's Big Brother?

24:18.790 --> 24:20.390
-Big Brother!
-Big Brother!

24:26.690 --> 24:27.450
Everyone.

24:28.720 --> 24:29.200
Here.

24:29.350 --> 24:30.050
Pass the wedding candies

24:30.050 --> 24:30.860
around.

24:31.030 --> 24:32.360
Please share in the joy.

24:32.590 --> 24:33.480
Congratulations.

24:33.480 --> 24:34.350
Thank you.

24:35.880 --> 24:37.140
Where are the bearers?

24:38.830 --> 24:39.790
I didn't see them

24:39.790 --> 24:40.880
when I came this morning.

24:40.880 --> 24:41.880
What are you waiting for?

24:41.880 --> 24:42.680
Go look for them immediately.

24:42.680 --> 24:43.240
Go!

24:43.260 --> 24:43.880
Hurry up.

24:43.990 --> 24:45.590
Help us look for them. Hurry.

25:00.350 --> 25:01.160
My Lord, here.

25:03.110 --> 25:03.960
The hat

25:04.030 --> 25:05.290
must be worn straight.

25:05.310 --> 25:06.350
When you mount and dismount the horse,

25:06.350 --> 25:07.110
keep your back

25:07.110 --> 25:08.240
upright.

25:08.720 --> 25:10.030
Let others see

25:10.240 --> 25:11.440
how handsome you are.

25:12.480 --> 25:13.810
The wedding etiquette

25:14.000 --> 25:15.000
is very complicated,

25:15.000 --> 25:16.730
so I've repeated it a few times.

25:16.790 --> 25:18.550
Please don't mind my nagging, My Lord.

25:18.550 --> 25:19.380
I know.

25:25.300 --> 25:26.080
Who are you?

25:26.110 --> 25:26.910
Who let you in?

25:27.270 --> 25:28.960
I just want to have a word with you,

25:28.960 --> 25:30.090
and then I'll leave.

25:30.680 --> 25:31.310
Trust me.

25:33.950 --> 25:34.750
You may leave.

25:36.690 --> 25:37.120
Yes.

25:42.240 --> 25:43.730
Today is my wedding day.

25:44.480 --> 25:45.480
I'm in a good mood.

25:46.030 --> 25:47.160
Just tell me what you want.

25:47.160 --> 25:48.680
Why make such a fuss?

25:48.880 --> 25:50.160
I don't need this.

25:51.270 --> 25:51.830
I just hope

25:51.830 --> 25:53.020
you can listen carefully

25:53.020 --> 25:54.350
to what I'm about to say.

25:56.010 --> 25:56.400
Okay.

25:58.240 --> 25:58.790
Go ahead.

26:00.350 --> 26:02.440
My real name is Jiu Xuanye.

26:03.070 --> 26:03.830
Jiu Xuanye.

26:04.440 --> 26:06.640
I'm a demon hunter from Ganshan Clinic.

26:07.200 --> 26:08.720
Your real surname is not Huang.

26:08.720 --> 26:10.120
You're just a constable.

26:10.310 --> 26:11.310
Your surname is Chu,

26:11.310 --> 26:12.880
and your first name is Youhuang.

26:12.880 --> 26:13.800
Chu Youhuang.

26:16.440 --> 26:18.190
This is not Guangping City.

26:18.330 --> 26:19.640
This is just a bookstore

26:19.640 --> 26:20.700
in the Underground City.

26:20.700 --> 26:21.830
The owner of this bookstore

26:21.830 --> 26:23.510
is a demon who is good at drawing.

26:23.510 --> 26:24.400
This Guangping City is only

26:24.400 --> 26:25.960
a city in his painting.

26:30.160 --> 26:30.830
Demon?

26:32.750 --> 26:33.240
Right.

26:33.550 --> 26:35.310
You didn't believe any of these before, either.

26:35.310 --> 26:36.440
Only after you saw

26:36.460 --> 26:37.360
the Mirror Demon

26:37.360 --> 26:39.110
escaped from your sword with your own eyes

26:39.110 --> 26:39.720
did you start to believe that

26:39.720 --> 26:41.850
there really are demons in this world.

26:42.640 --> 26:44.240
Is that so?

26:46.590 --> 26:47.240
Now,

26:47.550 --> 26:48.440
we are not the only two

26:48.440 --> 26:49.750
trapped in this painting,

26:49.750 --> 26:50.610
Banxia is, too.

26:51.760 --> 26:52.340
She's that

26:52.340 --> 26:54.000
young lady from the martial arts school

26:54.000 --> 26:55.460
who you're about to marry.

26:55.550 --> 26:57.000
The three brothers who are going to carry the sedan chair

26:57.000 --> 26:59.330
together with me are trapped here as well.

27:06.830 --> 27:07.440
How is it?

27:08.110 --> 27:10.000
Do you recall anything?

27:10.960 --> 27:11.510
No.

27:13.030 --> 27:14.270
So, you're doubting

27:14.590 --> 27:15.720
what I said just now?

27:15.830 --> 27:17.240
Isn't it obvious enough?

27:23.590 --> 27:24.350
Although...

27:24.830 --> 27:25.680
Although I haven't figured out

27:25.680 --> 27:26.200
the rules

27:26.200 --> 27:27.400
in this painting yet,

27:27.600 --> 27:28.040
I can

27:28.070 --> 27:29.330
prove one thing to you.

27:36.920 --> 27:38.980
This was left to me by my grandfather!

27:39.030 --> 27:40.310
It's all fake.

27:41.680 --> 27:42.200
Do you even know

27:42.200 --> 27:43.260
what you are doing?

27:43.790 --> 27:45.260
I'm trying to prove to you

27:45.290 --> 27:45.970
that in this painting,

27:45.970 --> 27:47.240
everything that's destroyed

27:47.240 --> 27:48.710
will return to its original form,

27:48.710 --> 27:49.970
which is this ink mark!

27:50.580 --> 27:51.840
Do you understand now?

27:56.720 --> 27:57.480
Yes.

27:59.310 --> 28:00.510
I understand now.

28:02.110 --> 28:03.040
You understand?

28:05.890 --> 28:06.690
So,

28:07.110 --> 28:08.570
what do you plan to do next?

28:10.950 --> 28:11.660
Guards!

28:12.000 --> 28:14.440
Arrest him!

28:19.540 --> 28:20.600
What are you doing?

28:32.070 --> 28:33.400
Mr. Li. Mr. Li.

28:33.400 --> 28:34.730
Madam, come in, please.

28:34.880 --> 28:35.440
Okay.

28:36.000 --> 28:37.200
Mr. Zhang. Mr. Zhang.

28:37.440 --> 28:38.030
Please.

28:38.400 --> 28:39.400
Have some tea.

28:48.000 --> 28:48.750
It's him!

28:49.640 --> 28:51.900
Let's see where you can escape this time.

28:55.120 --> 28:56.480
Why is it so noisy outside?

28:56.480 --> 28:57.440
What happened?

28:58.100 --> 28:59.400
A sedan bearer from the Huang Residence

28:59.400 --> 29:00.590
climbed over the wall and sneaked in just now.

29:00.590 --> 29:01.200
My Lady.

29:01.510 --> 29:03.040
He seemed to be here for you.

29:03.480 --> 29:04.400
A bearer?

29:05.170 --> 29:06.370
You know him, My Lady?

29:06.680 --> 29:07.890
How could I?

29:10.590 --> 29:11.350
My Lady.

29:12.070 --> 29:13.200
It's almost auspicious hour.

29:13.200 --> 29:14.240
Are you ready?

29:15.030 --> 29:15.920
Yes.

29:19.440 --> 29:19.920
Here.

29:21.590 --> 29:22.920
Stay here and behave yourself!

29:22.920 --> 29:23.440
Let's go.

29:23.440 --> 29:23.970
Let's go.

29:32.310 --> 29:33.910
Look into the mirror and bow.

29:33.920 --> 29:35.250
The couple becomes one.

29:35.330 --> 29:37.590
Evil spirits shall be exorcised forever.

29:37.590 --> 29:38.640
The first kowtow is for

29:38.640 --> 29:39.900
growing old together,

29:40.370 --> 29:42.500
and living in harmony like lovebirds.

29:42.590 --> 29:43.920
The second kowtow is for

29:44.310 --> 29:46.000
expressing your gratitude to your parents for raising you,

29:46.000 --> 29:47.660
and wishing them good health.

29:49.030 --> 29:50.290
The third kowtow is for

29:50.370 --> 29:51.830
a harmonious marital life

29:52.200 --> 29:53.530
and being united as one.

29:54.160 --> 29:56.140
Tie a knot and finish the make-up.

29:56.720 --> 29:59.160
Join hands and enter the bridal chamber.

30:09.030 --> 30:09.590
One.

30:11.200 --> 30:11.830
Two.

30:13.160 --> 30:13.830
Three.

30:26.830 --> 30:27.560
Big Brother.

30:27.680 --> 30:28.440
Are you hurt?

30:29.190 --> 30:30.310
What are you waiting for?

30:30.310 --> 30:31.720
Help Big Brother up.

30:33.720 --> 30:34.640
Move your feet.

30:35.030 --> 30:35.510
Hurry.

30:40.350 --> 30:42.350
What's wrong with you, Big Brother?

30:42.680 --> 30:44.240
You look unwell, Big Brother.

30:44.240 --> 30:46.970
Did you h-hurt yourself somewhere, Big Brother?

30:48.440 --> 30:49.170
Big Brother.

30:49.200 --> 30:50.750
How about I get you a doctor?

30:52.070 --> 30:53.030
Big Brother, say something.

30:53.030 --> 30:54.030
Don't scare us.

31:04.200 --> 31:05.440
Am I your Big Brother?

31:05.830 --> 31:06.480
Yes.

31:07.640 --> 31:09.170
Will you listen to me or not?

31:09.550 --> 31:10.240
Yes.

31:11.750 --> 31:13.690
When mother died,

31:13.720 --> 31:16.160
she told us all to listen to Big Brother.

31:16.400 --> 31:18.480
We listen to Big Brother since Mother has passed away.

31:18.480 --> 31:21.120
We'll listen to Second Brother if Big Brother dies.

31:21.120 --> 31:22.270
Big Brother is not dead yet.

31:22.270 --> 31:23.550
So we still listen to Big Brother now.

31:23.550 --> 31:24.610
Alright. Alright.

31:27.110 --> 31:28.040
I have a favor

31:28.070 --> 31:28.960
to ask you now.

31:29.960 --> 31:30.890
Will you help me?

31:31.070 --> 31:31.590
Sure.

31:32.280 --> 31:32.740
Big Brother.

31:32.740 --> 31:33.880
What kind of talk is this?

31:33.880 --> 31:35.040
We are brothers.

31:35.130 --> 31:36.350
What do you mean do you a favor?

31:36.350 --> 31:37.070
If you need anything,

31:37.070 --> 31:38.680
just let us know.

31:39.160 --> 31:39.690
Exactly.

31:39.750 --> 31:40.830
If we brothers are of the same mind,

31:40.830 --> 31:41.920
our strength will be sharp enough to cut through...

31:41.920 --> 31:42.980
Cut through metal.

31:43.680 --> 31:44.200
Good!

31:45.790 --> 31:46.790
Here's the thing.

31:47.550 --> 31:48.640
There's something

31:49.160 --> 31:50.690
I've been keeping to myself

31:50.960 --> 31:52.160
and haven't told you.

31:52.720 --> 31:54.120
And I've been hesitating

31:54.640 --> 31:56.240
whether I should tell you or not.

31:56.240 --> 31:56.970
Big Brother.

31:57.750 --> 31:59.270
Just say it.

32:00.920 --> 32:01.440
Okay.

32:04.160 --> 32:05.160
Here's the thing.

32:06.350 --> 32:07.420
I went out

32:07.960 --> 32:08.920
a few days ago.

32:09.750 --> 32:10.900
When I was out...

32:11.310 --> 32:12.040
Big Brother.

32:12.070 --> 32:13.270
When did you go out?

32:13.270 --> 32:14.270
I don't remember.

32:14.550 --> 32:15.070
Right.

32:15.090 --> 32:16.530
We were sleeping at home that day.

32:16.530 --> 32:17.270
Listen to me.

32:20.310 --> 32:21.070
I went out

32:21.920 --> 32:22.880
a few days ago.

32:24.680 --> 32:25.770
I first went south,

32:26.000 --> 32:28.070
and then I went north.

32:29.030 --> 32:29.720
Anyway,

32:29.750 --> 32:30.920
I met a girl.

32:32.110 --> 32:33.590
After I met that girl...

32:35.170 --> 32:36.210
So it turns out

32:36.440 --> 32:38.200
Big Brother met a girl he likes.

32:38.290 --> 32:39.400
Big Brother has fallen in love.

32:39.400 --> 32:40.730
He's got a story to tell.

32:42.550 --> 32:43.880
-Naughty.
-Story.

32:44.110 --> 32:46.570
Looks like you are not that stupid after all.

32:46.830 --> 32:48.400
Big Brother, after all,

32:48.760 --> 32:50.280
where is that girl from?

32:50.310 --> 32:51.830
Which city?

32:52.240 --> 32:54.240
She's a local, from Guangping City.

32:55.200 --> 32:56.470
What a coincidence.

32:56.590 --> 32:57.160
Exactly.

32:57.270 --> 32:58.350
What a coincidence.

32:58.350 --> 33:00.410
We are familiar with Guangping City.

33:00.510 --> 33:01.510
Which family is she from?

33:01.510 --> 33:02.750
What's her surname?

33:03.200 --> 33:04.200
Let's go find her.

33:04.510 --> 33:06.350
She's the girl from the martial arts school.

33:06.350 --> 33:07.010
Martial...

33:07.160 --> 33:07.790
Martial...

33:07.790 --> 33:08.550
Martial...

33:08.920 --> 33:09.720
Stop imitating me.

33:09.720 --> 33:10.660
Shut up.

33:12.030 --> 33:13.560
Which martial arts school?

33:13.960 --> 33:15.960
Which martial arts school can it be?

33:16.070 --> 33:16.680
He...

33:17.350 --> 33:18.810
He's Martial Arts School?

33:19.110 --> 33:19.680
Yes.

33:20.730 --> 33:21.400
Isn't that

33:22.300 --> 33:22.890
the bride

33:22.920 --> 33:24.830
we're going to pick up later?

33:25.270 --> 33:25.750
Yes.

33:26.310 --> 33:28.370
Are you out of your mind, Big Brother?

33:29.070 --> 33:30.000
Do you know

33:30.030 --> 33:31.090
who her husband is?

33:32.430 --> 33:33.920
He's famous for his fierceness.

33:33.920 --> 33:35.280
Back when he went to suppress bandits on the mountain,

33:35.280 --> 33:36.300
he killed a dozen bandits

33:36.300 --> 33:37.750
all by himself.

33:38.160 --> 33:40.440
He's murderous.

33:40.790 --> 33:41.440
Big Brother.

33:41.440 --> 33:42.570
He's really brutal.

33:43.160 --> 33:44.020
Are you scared?

33:44.440 --> 33:45.030
So you aren't going to

33:45.030 --> 33:46.690
help your Big Brother, right?

33:47.010 --> 33:47.830
You've forgotten

33:47.830 --> 33:48.960
what your mother told you, right?

33:48.960 --> 33:50.000
I... I...

33:50.880 --> 33:53.310
I-I'm not scared.

33:53.930 --> 33:54.720
Brother, you are scared.

33:54.720 --> 33:55.330
You are more or less...

33:55.330 --> 33:56.090
Shut up!

33:57.830 --> 33:59.290
We are not bandits.

33:59.520 --> 34:00.350
Even if we are caught,

34:00.350 --> 34:01.160
we won't die.

34:03.120 --> 34:04.160
In short,

34:04.890 --> 34:05.520
will you

34:05.550 --> 34:06.610
kidnap the bride

34:06.750 --> 34:08.350
with your Big Brother or not?

34:11.760 --> 34:12.440
I...

34:14.310 --> 34:15.150
Good brothers.

34:15.150 --> 34:16.150
Are In the heart.

34:18.190 --> 34:20.330
We are brothers. We are the closest people in this world.

34:20.330 --> 34:21.389
What about you two?

34:23.440 --> 34:24.030
Brother.

34:24.530 --> 34:26.730
The atmosphere has reached this point.

34:29.350 --> 34:29.889
Well,

34:30.050 --> 34:30.929
we'll go too.

34:32.320 --> 34:32.800
Good!

34:33.590 --> 34:35.320
I knew I wasn't wrong about you.

34:35.929 --> 34:37.190
If we brothers are of the same mind,

34:37.190 --> 34:38.710
our strength will be sharp enough to cut through...

34:38.710 --> 34:39.310
Metal!

34:41.030 --> 34:42.090
Congratulations.

34:42.230 --> 34:43.409
Congratulations.

34:43.440 --> 34:44.000
Congratulations.

34:44.000 --> 34:45.199
Thank you, thank you.

34:45.280 --> 34:46.070
Congratulations, Lord Huang.

34:46.070 --> 34:47.130
Congratulations.

34:47.150 --> 34:47.960
Congratulations, Lord Huang.

34:47.960 --> 34:48.710
Thank you.

34:49.190 --> 34:50.550
Congratulations, Lord Huang.

34:50.550 --> 34:51.449
Thank you.

34:53.510 --> 34:55.000
Congratulations.

34:59.890 --> 35:01.180
Wait a bit longer.

35:01.510 --> 35:02.570
Congratulations.

35:03.920 --> 35:04.820
Stop!

35:09.110 --> 35:09.800
Get ready.

35:17.320 --> 35:17.980
Hold tight.

35:20.480 --> 35:21.000
Run!

35:24.280 --> 35:25.140
What happened?

35:25.320 --> 35:26.000
What are they doing?

35:26.000 --> 35:27.260
They're running away.

35:30.960 --> 35:32.400
Where are they taking the sedan chair?

35:32.400 --> 35:33.670
What's going on?

35:34.120 --> 35:35.000
Have those four guys

35:35.000 --> 35:36.860
never seen a funeral procession?

35:38.610 --> 35:39.280
Quelian?

35:40.880 --> 35:41.590
Quelian!

35:41.920 --> 35:42.630
Make way!

35:42.920 --> 35:43.920
Make way!

35:45.800 --> 35:47.400
What kind of people are they?

35:54.590 --> 35:55.190
Watch out!

35:56.100 --> 35:57.310
Stop, stop!

35:57.940 --> 35:59.330
Stop!

36:05.600 --> 36:06.600
Who are you guys?

36:06.800 --> 36:08.110
You kidnapped me during my wedding in broad daylight.

36:08.110 --> 36:09.110
Do you wish to die?

36:13.240 --> 36:14.010
Sit tight.

36:14.110 --> 36:15.230
I'll explain to you later.

36:15.230 --> 36:15.710
Okay?

36:16.070 --> 36:16.600
Let's go!

36:34.320 --> 36:34.850
Brother.

36:34.860 --> 36:35.930
She smells so good.

36:37.230 --> 36:38.080
She's asleep.

36:39.110 --> 36:40.570
Big Brother is asleep too.

36:41.070 --> 36:42.930
Do you think Big Brother is tired?

36:46.840 --> 36:47.670
Who's asleep?

36:49.280 --> 36:49.880
Big Brother, you're awake.

36:49.880 --> 36:50.390
Shut up.

36:50.420 --> 36:51.750
You woke Big Brother up.

36:52.760 --> 36:53.590
Let's go out.

36:53.650 --> 36:54.380
Let's go.

36:56.310 --> 36:56.840
Go.

37:19.880 --> 37:20.680
You're awake.

37:21.440 --> 37:22.440
Where am I?

37:24.800 --> 37:26.590
This is just a shack.

37:28.150 --> 37:29.550
Why did you bring me here?

37:31.400 --> 37:32.230
Those from the Huang Residence

37:32.230 --> 37:33.960
won't be able to find us for now.

37:38.400 --> 37:39.320
You are alone?

37:40.200 --> 37:41.850
Where are your accomplices?

37:43.060 --> 37:44.060
They are outside.

37:48.030 --> 37:49.060
So,

37:49.230 --> 37:51.000
are you trying to rob me

37:51.030 --> 37:52.150
or kill me?

37:53.920 --> 37:54.920
Neither.

37:56.630 --> 37:57.960
So you want to molest me?

37:59.890 --> 38:00.840
Do you have any other questions

38:00.840 --> 38:01.700
you want to ask?

38:02.190 --> 38:02.960
If not,

38:03.540 --> 38:04.580
just listen to me.

38:05.030 --> 38:06.230
What I'm about to say

38:06.250 --> 38:08.120
might sound unbelievable

38:08.150 --> 38:09.340
and nonsensical to you.

38:09.340 --> 38:10.180
But I swear,

38:10.360 --> 38:11.760
everything I say is true.

38:12.360 --> 38:14.190
I hope you can listen patiently to

38:14.190 --> 38:14.790
what I say,

38:15.000 --> 38:16.150
and then decide

38:16.710 --> 38:18.310
whether to believe me or not.

38:20.210 --> 38:20.890
Okay?

38:30.360 --> 38:31.810
Did you two h-hear...

38:36.710 --> 38:38.000
That's about it.

38:39.960 --> 38:41.510
So you mean,

38:42.230 --> 38:43.250
my real surname is not He.

38:43.250 --> 38:45.590
My surname is Duan, and my full name is Duan Banxia?

38:45.590 --> 38:46.070
Yes.

38:46.410 --> 38:47.600
My current parents

38:47.630 --> 38:49.160
are not my real parents.

38:49.600 --> 38:50.230
My husband

38:50.260 --> 38:51.920
is not my real husband either.

38:52.230 --> 38:53.030
That's right.

38:55.190 --> 38:55.760
I...

38:56.960 --> 38:59.800
We are trapped in a painting.

39:00.280 --> 39:01.180
This painting

39:01.400 --> 39:02.960
was drawn by a demon.

39:04.230 --> 39:04.960
Yes. Right.

39:07.280 --> 39:08.740
Do you think I believe you?

39:11.150 --> 39:12.810
Are you willing to believe me?

39:15.230 --> 39:16.880
Although what you said

39:16.880 --> 39:18.010
sounds ridiculous,

39:18.400 --> 39:19.880
for some reason,

39:20.640 --> 39:21.600
I just feel like

39:21.630 --> 39:22.880
I should believe you.

39:22.880 --> 39:23.800
According to what you said,

39:23.800 --> 39:25.730
when I think about it carefully...

39:25.800 --> 39:26.670
Indeed.

39:27.400 --> 39:29.480
When I woke up this morning,

39:30.070 --> 39:31.280
I had a headache.

39:32.420 --> 39:33.750
I felt dizzy and groggy,

39:34.120 --> 39:35.720
like I was dreaming.

39:36.810 --> 39:37.800
Yes. That's right.

39:37.800 --> 39:39.930
I was like that on the first day as well.

39:40.030 --> 39:40.760
And

39:41.620 --> 39:43.410
many things I did

39:44.110 --> 39:45.950
felt familiar.

39:46.000 --> 39:48.200
They just felt somewhat familiar to me.

39:49.910 --> 39:50.850
I think

39:50.930 --> 39:51.630
you should be able to restore your memory

39:51.630 --> 39:52.710
very soon.

39:54.970 --> 39:55.640
But even if

39:55.670 --> 39:57.030
I recall everything,

39:57.750 --> 39:58.510
we still don't know

39:58.510 --> 39:59.550
how to get out.

40:02.400 --> 40:03.230
Actually,

40:03.710 --> 40:05.570
I've thought about it carefully.

40:06.030 --> 40:06.960
This painting

40:07.230 --> 40:08.550
should be the longest painting

40:08.550 --> 40:09.880
in Enlightenment Bookstore.

40:09.880 --> 40:11.070
It's one of that demon's

40:11.070 --> 40:11.880
best works.

40:12.670 --> 40:13.280
You,

40:13.590 --> 40:14.190
I,

40:14.610 --> 40:15.290
Youhuang,

40:15.700 --> 40:17.190
and the three brothers outside

40:17.190 --> 40:19.050
are all trapped in this painting.

40:20.400 --> 40:21.110
Besides,

40:21.590 --> 40:22.400
your parents

40:22.510 --> 40:24.000
may be trapped here too.

40:26.590 --> 40:27.550
This demon

40:27.830 --> 40:29.890
is so obsessed with your parents that

40:30.150 --> 40:31.430
even after over 10 years,

40:31.430 --> 40:32.960
it still sent Chi Wangchuan

40:32.960 --> 40:34.510
to kidnap your father.

40:35.550 --> 40:36.430
I guess

40:37.010 --> 40:37.740
your parents

40:37.840 --> 40:39.070
are probably

40:39.070 --> 40:40.060
the finishing touch of this painting.

40:40.060 --> 40:41.340
They are the important characters.

40:41.340 --> 40:42.630
If we can find your parents,

40:42.630 --> 40:43.360
we may be able to find a way

40:43.360 --> 40:44.280
to get out.

40:45.670 --> 40:47.030
I think you have a point.

40:50.760 --> 40:51.560
You know what?

40:51.800 --> 40:53.070
I tried to

40:53.070 --> 40:54.480
awaken Youhuang before,

40:54.510 --> 40:56.240
but he didn't believe me at all.

40:56.670 --> 40:57.480
Fortunately.

40:57.740 --> 40:59.400
Fortunately, you believe me.

41:02.150 --> 41:03.550
Of course I believe you.

41:05.710 --> 41:06.510
It's just that

41:06.760 --> 41:09.280
I haven't eaten anything

41:09.780 --> 41:11.300
since this morning.

41:13.920 --> 41:14.710
Wait for me.

41:15.030 --> 41:16.280
I'll get you something to eat.

41:16.280 --> 41:16.630
Okay.

41:24.630 --> 41:25.630
Full of nonsense.

41:25.670 --> 41:27.070
Do you think I'm an idiot?

41:35.190 --> 41:35.920
Big Brother.

41:36.000 --> 41:36.840
Are you hurt?

41:37.930 --> 41:38.590
What are you waiting for?

41:38.590 --> 41:39.960
Help Big Brother up.

41:42.190 --> 41:42.920
Big Brother.

41:46.150 --> 41:47.510
What's wrong with you, Big Brother?

41:47.510 --> 41:48.880
You look unwell, Big Brother.

41:48.880 --> 41:50.030
Did you h-hurt yourself somewhere?

41:50.030 --> 41:50.830
Stop talking.

41:51.920 --> 41:52.780
Leave me alone.

41:52.960 --> 41:53.690
Big Brother.

41:53.760 --> 41:55.290
How about I get you a doctor?

41:58.190 --> 41:59.390
I'm your Big Brother.

41:59.590 --> 42:00.790
Will you listen to me?

42:02.760 --> 42:03.440
Sure.

42:04.400 --> 42:05.460
Congratulations.

42:05.670 --> 42:06.730
Congratulations.

42:10.480 --> 42:11.140
Hold tight.

42:12.400 --> 42:12.960
Run!

42:19.440 --> 42:20.400
What's going on?

42:20.880 --> 42:21.710
Have these four guys

42:21.710 --> 42:23.570
never seen a funeral procession?

42:26.550 --> 42:27.110
Quelian?

42:28.510 --> 42:29.150
Quelian!

42:29.480 --> 42:30.070
Quelian!

42:30.360 --> 42:32.600
Make way!

42:47.290 --> 42:48.950
Why are you all kneeling here?

42:49.290 --> 42:51.490
Waiting to pay your last respects to me?

42:54.110 --> 42:55.250
Stand up now!

42:55.360 --> 42:56.200
Get out there and

42:56.200 --> 42:57.410
find her!

42:57.960 --> 42:58.670
Hurry!

42:59.150 --> 43:00.110
Yes.

43:09.190 --> 43:09.670
My Lord.

43:10.130 --> 43:11.070
Please calm down.

43:11.070 --> 43:11.870
I'm not angry!

43:12.550 --> 43:13.550
I'm just worried.

43:16.710 --> 43:17.800
As an official,

43:18.590 --> 43:19.070
I must have

43:19.070 --> 43:20.870
offended many people in my life.

43:21.320 --> 43:22.110
I'm worried that

43:22.110 --> 43:24.910
they'll take the chance to take revenge on my wife.

43:29.760 --> 43:30.840
Don't worry, My Lord.

43:30.840 --> 43:32.030
All the officials in the city

43:32.030 --> 43:33.530
are trying their best to apprehend the kidnappers.

43:33.530 --> 43:34.310
I believe

43:34.550 --> 43:36.480
we'll find Her Ladyship very soon.

43:38.030 --> 43:38.630
No.

43:40.460 --> 43:41.340
This is not enough.
